Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":5196730,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":null,"divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":false,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":false,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":"price_not_announced"},{"game_id":"steam-5196730","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:28Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":5196730,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-5196730","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:28Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":5196730,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-5196730-1847286114043371","game_id":"steam-5196730","kind":"announcement","title":"Release Announcement","summary":"It's been a long road to get here, but we are finally ready to announce the release date for our game. There is still some work to be done, but we are on track for our release goal. We have been saying for a while we want to release by the end of the year, with a goal of the end of November. We are happy to announce that Eldwyn's Dungeon Academy will be releasing on November 25th at a price of $4.99. There will be a launch sale, with the discount to be announced closer to release. Thank you to e","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-26T01:41:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114043371","verified_at":"2026-10-26T09:28:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5196730-1847286114041703","game_id":"steam-5196730","kind":"announcement","title":"0.11.0 - Camera Zoom Option","summary":"We have received some feedback on our proposal to change the camera zoom, with varying preferences. It can be hard to really make a good decision just from some screenshots of 1 room, so we have updated the game to allow adjusting the zoom level during gameplay. This is only intended for the current testing/review and not planned to remain for the full game, though some form may make it in. You can adjust it from 1.0x, which is what the game was originally using, to 2.0x. The default is 1.5x. We","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T11:13:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041703","verified_at":"2026-10-25T12:33:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5196730-1847286114033817","game_id":"steam-5196730","kind":"announcement","title":"Camera Zoom Change","summary":"Based on some feedback, we are thinking of changing the camera zoom for the game. Currently you can see all of most rooms. Some rooms, such as the example below, are larger and the camera will follow you as you move. We received a comment that maybe we were showing too much. We went ahead and experimented with different zoom levels. We are liking 1.5x. What do you think? We'd love to hear feedback from players before we make a final decision. Below I have some screenshots of one of the trap room","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T18:26:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033817","verified_at":"2026-10-22T18:54:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5196730-1846651706688869","game_id":"steam-5196730","kind":"announcement","title":"0.10.1 - Polishing","summary":"After releasing our last update we found some little things that were not quite right, so here we are with another update. The main change here is that the popup notifications have been updated to allow more variety between different types. The popups for Achievements are meant to be big and stand out. The ones for not being able to collect something, however, have the potential to be far too common and start to feel annoying or in the way after a while. Before we added Achievements, the popups ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T05:23:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688869","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:16:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5196730-1846651706686648","game_id":"steam-5196730","kind":"announcement","title":"0.10.0 - Balancing","summary":"Another day, another update. In this update we have done balancing and reworked the dungeons a bit. Certain enemies, including bosses, have been updated. Some have been renamed. Some have had some art updated. Some have been made more challenging. Many anti-dash crystals have been removed and the puzzle or trap redesigned to not need them. Scoring has been updated to reduce the penalty for using continues.There are now many more Achievements, and types of Achievements. We also updated the order ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T10:13:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686648","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:16:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5196730-1846651706684287","game_id":"steam-5196730","kind":"announcement","title":"0.9.0 - Achievements Unlocked","summary":"Achievements have been added to the game. This first batch focuses on defeating enemies and breakable objects. Additional achievements are planned covering other areas. As you complete them, a notification will show. You can see which you have completed from the main menu. Incomplete ones will be greyed out. Some will only show question marks until you complete them. Can you get them all? Some enemy and trap attacks have been updated. The main one is a change in the Dash Trap that will make it h","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T10:43:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684287","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:16:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5196730-1846651706679720","game_id":"steam-5196730","kind":"announcement","title":"0.8.0 - UI/UX Feedback","summary":"As Next Fest approaches we are working to get some final changes out. This update is largely based on recent feedback from ShiftyGameDev's Twitch stream of our game and trying to make things clearer to the player. We created our dragon characters a while ago and designed them to work with an asset pack we were using at the time. They have largely had small roles and we've simply carried them over from game to game. While Eldwyn is not a playable character, they are more notable for this game, so","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T01:15:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679720","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:16:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5196730-1846018067928438","game_id":"steam-5196730","kind":"announcement","title":"0.7.0 - Intro Cutscene","summary":"We have updated the game's intro sequence. There is now a short cutscene of Eldwyn speaking to a group of students, before they portal away to take their exam/quiz. This can be turned of from the main menu, allowing you to get right into the game on replays.The main menu has also been updated. This was originally created for a game jam, and the menu had largely stayed with the Spin to Win theme of the jam, while the rest of the game evolved away from it. The menu now better fits the game. It als","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T05:58:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928438","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:16:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5196730-1845383656379238","game_id":"steam-5196730","kind":"announcement","title":"0.6.0 - Voice Acting & Steam Demo","summary":"We've made a number of changes for this release. The highlight is the voice acting. All dialog is now fully voiced. There are currently 2 characters, each with their own voice and personality.This is also the first version being released as a demo on Steam.In the Dialog tab there is an option to disable dialog VO. Under the Audio tab there is a new slider to adjust the VO volume. We've reduced the default background music to 40%, and the VO defaults to 60%. We will be adjusting the volumes of th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T23:49:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656379238","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:16:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5196730":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:28:52Z","status":"ok","all_sources_check